@base = http://localhost:5205
@email = demo@example.com
# Pegá acá los valores que devuelven login / refresh
@accessToken =
@refreshToken =
@userId =

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Verify email (el código llega a Mailpit: http://localhost:8025)
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "code": "123456", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Resend verification
POST {{base}}/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Refresh
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Forgot password (el token llega a Mailpit)
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### Reset password
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "token": "pegar-token", "newPassword": "Reset123x" }

### Me
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Sessions
GET {{base}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Change password
POST {{base}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "oldPassword": "Passw0rd!", "newPassword": "NewPassw0rd" }

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete my account (borrado lógico)
DELETE {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Admin login (usuario sembrado en Development)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@identity.local", "password": "Admin12345" }

### Admin: list users (incluye borrados)
GET {{base}}/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20&includeDeleted=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: auditoría (filtrable por userId y action)
GET {{base}}/admin/audit?pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### JWKS (claves públicas para otros servicios)
GET {{base}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### Health
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### MFA: estado
GET {{base}}/auth/mfa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### MFA: setup (devuelve el secreto y el otpauth:// para el QR)
POST {{base}}/auth/mfa/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### MFA: activar con un código de la app (devuelve los códigos de recuperación, una sola vez)
POST {{base}}/auth/mfa/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "123456" }

### Login, segundo paso (con mfaToken del login; code o recoveryCode)
POST {{base}}/auth/login/mfa
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mfaToken": "pegar-mfaToken", "code": "123456" }

### MFA: desactivar
POST {{base}}/auth/mfa/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "Passw0rd!", "code": "123456" }

### Admin: crear un rol con permisos
POST {{base}}/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Support", "description": "Lee usuarios", "permissions": ["users.read"] }

### Admin: cambiar los permisos de un rol
PUT {{base}}/admin/roles/Support/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "permissions": ["users.read", "audit.read"] }

### Admin: bloquear un usuario (revoca sus sesiones; se deshace con /unlock)
POST {{base}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: sesiones de un usuario (con el motivo de revocación)
GET {{base}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: revocar todas las sesiones de un usuario
DELETE {{base}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Login en modo cookies (frontend web): los tokens quedan en cookies HttpOnly
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "Passw0rd!", "useCookies": true }

### Refresh por cookie (sin body). Requiere el valor de la cookie __Host-identity-csrf en el header
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
X-CSRF-Token: pegar-valor-de-la-cookie-csrf
